@765 = ~Entropy Shield~
@766 = ~Entropy Shield (Evocation)
Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round / 2 levels
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

When cast, this spell surrounds the warlord with a defensive maelstrom of energy that blocks or deflects many attacks. This gives the warlord a +2 bonus to armor class, +1 every 3 levels (max +9 at level 21) and damage resistance equal to 2% per point of the AC bonus. At level 18, it also gives the warlord immunity to nonmagical missile-based attacks (though well-thrown axes and spears can still penetrate it).~
@7661 = ~Entropy Shield (Evocation)
Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 13 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

When cast, this spell surrounds the warlord with a defensive maelstrom of energy that blocks or deflects many attacks. This gives the warlord a +9 bonus to armor class and 18% resistance to damage. It also gives the warlord immunity to nonmagical missile-based attacks (though well-thrown axes and spears can still penetrate it).~
@7662 = ~Entropy Shield (Evocation)
Level: 6
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 13 rounds
