@7617 = ~Frenzy~
@7618 = ~Frenzy (Alteration)
Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell greatly accelerates the warlord, increasing his movement speed by 150%, doubling his attacks per round and adding one more attack, and granting +4 to speed factor and +2 to casting speed and AC. Frenzy does not stack with other haste spells, and does not negate a slow spell.~
