their movement speed doubles, and they gain 2 attacks per round, +3 to speed factor and +1 to casting speed and armor class for 2 turns.~

@7619 = ~Hail~
@7620 = ~Hail (Evocation)
Level: 6
Range: 30 meters
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: radius 9 meters
Saving Throw: special

This spell forms growing blocks of ice above the chosen area. When they become too heavy for the magic holding them aloft, they crash down and scatter cold and icy shards. Creatures caught in the hail suffer 10D8 points of crushing damage and 4D6 points of cold damage. A successful save vs. spell halves the cold damage. Avoiding the ice blocks is harder: a save at -4 halves the crushing damage.~
@76201 = ~Hail (Evocation)
Level: 6
Range: 30 meters
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: radius 9 meters
Saving Throw: special

This spell forms growing blocks of ice above the chosen area. When they become too heavy for the magic holding them aloft, they crash down and scatter cold and icy shards. Creatures caught in the hail suffer 10D8 points of crushing damage and 4D6 points of cold damage. A successful save vs. spell halves the cold damage. Avoiding the ice blocks is harder: a save at -4 halves the crushing damage.~

@7621 = ~Devil Hand~
@7622 = ~Devil Hand (Necromancy)
Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: special
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

Devil Hand is a particularly evil spell, which aims to kill a creature with a single touch. To do so, the spell charges the warlord's main hand with dark energy from the Negative Energy Plane.
Once the hand is altered, the mage cannot hold a weapon anymore. The transformation lasts 3 rounds, during which if he touches a creature, he transfers the energy to it. The creature must make a successful save vs. death or will instantly die. If the saving throw is successful, the effect of the evil energy is reduced and drains one experience level instead.
All the negative energy passes to the target on contact, so the warlord can only make a single touch.
The warlord recovers use of his hand after 3 rounds or a touch.~
@76221 = ~Deadly Touch~
@76222 = ~Devil Hand (Necromancy)
