@7623 = ~Fighter Resurgence~
@7624 = ~Fighter Resurgence (Alteration)
Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round / level
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell gives the warlord who needs a significant improvement of his fighting skills a simple option: to revive his old skills, as if he had never lost them.
By casting this spell, the warlord regains the fighter abilities he would have developed through uninterrupted martial training. His THAC0 and saving throws become those of a fighter of his current mage level plus two, and he gains 2 temporary hit points per level and a second base attack if he has only one. He also gets an innate mastery at maximum level of all weapons and fighting styles he practiced during his training.
The spell works by altering the warlord's knowledge. His arcane knowledge is suppressed for its duration, preventing him from casting spells.~
@76241 = ~Fighter Resurgence (Alteration)
Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell gives the warlord who needs a significant improvement of his fighting skills a simple option: to revive his old skills, as if he had never lost them.
By casting this spell, the warlord regains the fighter abilities he would have developed through uninterrupted martial training. His THAC0 and saving throws become those of a fighter of 20th level, and he gains 40 temporary hit points and a second base attack if he has only one. He also gets an innate mastery at maximum level of all weapons and fighting styles he practiced during his training.
The spell works by altering the warlord's knowledge. His arcane knowledge is suppressed for its duration, preventing him from casting spells.~
@762411 = ~You cannot use magic under the effect of Fighter Resurgence~
@76242 = ~Fighter Resurgence (Alteration)
Level: 6
