This spell is used to protect the warlord against all bodily afflictions. When he casts Fortitude, an exceptionally potent vital force flows through his veins. As long as this force is inside him, the warlord is immune to poison, disease, level drain, ability score drain and magical death. He also gets a bonus of +5 to saving throw vs. poison/death against other effects. He regenerates 1 HP per round and gets 3 extra hit points per level, which are removed when the spell expires.~
