Level: 6
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 4 turns
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell is used to protect the recipient against all bodily afflictions. When the warlord casts Fortitude, an exceptionally potent vital force flows through the veins of the recipient. As long as this force is inside him, he is immune to poison, disease, level drain, ability score drain and magical death. He also gets a bonus of +5 to saving throw vs. poison/death against other effects. He regenerates 1 HP per round and gets 60 extra hit points, which are removed when the spell expires.

All allies within 5 meters of the recipient also benefit from reduced effects of the spell:
They get the same immunities, +3 to saving throws, +40 HP and a 2 HP regeneration every 3 rounds for 26 rounds.~

